__Posts ({(["time":780515077,"author":"Descartes","post":"There may be access problems.  Check into the following scenariosbefore mailing me:1) I do not have access to the domain I used to.The domain elder for that domain must specifically grant you accessusing the grant command.2) Currently, all read/write security is stack based.  UID's areirrelevant.  However, function calls are EUID protected.  Sincethe master object no longer supports EUID/UID security, there maybe some such functions which are not working.  It is going totake time for me to fix those.Therefore, report any other insteances of not having read/writeaccess.    -Descartes","subject":"Access Problems","read":({"drakken","lightstar","blodgett","dana","bohemund","levric","mikla","descartes","manny","lassondra","darkone","carmen","cobalt","murmur","firebird","forlock","surpha","gregon","blitzed","dupart","korvacks","aleas","grumpy","thekiller","blackthorn","rafael",}),]),(["time":780722876,"author":"Descartes","post":"Do not ever help mortals by moving them or anythingof the sort.  The only thing you may do...IF they report no existAND IF the room has no descriptionAND IF there are no arches onlinegoto the room and type updateThat is all.Never move the player.    -Descartes","subject":"\"helping\" players","read":({"lightstar","blodgett","bohemund","dana","levric","mikla","descartes","manny","lassondra","darkone","carmen","cobalt","murmur","forlock","blitzed","gregon","dupart","korvacks","grumpy","rafael",}),]),(["author":"Rafael","time":780749641,"subject":"Batch files","post":"Greetings,   I was wondering if it is possible to develop some sort of \"batch file\", thatis, a file which allows you to run many commands when you run it, just as ifyou had typed them yourself at the command line. I seem to remember that some-thing like that existed, but I can't find it. If someone knows and wants tohelp me, please mail me.Forwarded thanks,Rafael","read":({"lightstar","blodgett","dana","bohemund","levric","descartes","manny","lassondra","darkone","carmen","cobalt","murmur","forlock","gregon","blitzed","dupart","korvacks","grumpy","rafael",}),]),(["author":"Dana","time":780945485,"subject":"peer","post":"Peer does not work in many places that it used to. Should there be something in a room's code or is it a bug?","read":({"forlock","lightstar","dana","carmen","cobalt","murmur",}),]),})
